WEBVTT - Malaba One-Stop Border Post Passenger Orientation

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to Uganda, the Pearl of Africa! I am Inspector David Okello from Immigration.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Present your valid passport and approved eVisa at the clearance counters.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
East African Community citizens may cross using an Interstate Pass or National ID.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Temporary Movement Passes are issued here for residents without passports.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Verify your Yellow Fever card at Port Health and declare goods at Customs.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Receive your entry stamp and proceed safely through the final exit gate.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Safe travels in the Pearl of Africa with Pearl Travel Border Guide.

